# Tables

Canonical: Sales / Purchases via `DomainListPage` → `DataTable`.

- Outer wrapper: `.zarva-glass-card`; thead `bg-nested` + `border-border` (see `DataTable`)
- Scrollbar: `.zarva-scrollbar` only — never `jaryan-scrollbar`
- Fill remaining viewport height; scroll inside the table box
- Footer: total + prev/next only (no page X/Y)
- Prefer `DataTable` over raw `<table>` for new list pages
- Small screens: horizontal scroll (table `min-w`) or card list
- **Status / payment / read chips:** always `StatusBadge` with `icon` + `tone` — see `.cursor/rules/status-chip.mdc`. No text-only pills.
